# A .rc file of your own owns the module's resources. RiftBuild generates no version script
# next to it, because two VERSIONINFO blocks reach the linker as one duplicate resource and
# fail with CVT1100. The metadata keys below stay legal and keep working everywhere else -
# they just produce no resource here. main.c checks that custom.rc reached the exe and that
# nothing was generated alongside it.
Assembly            CustomRcMetadataTest
SourceFiles         main
SourceFiles:windows custom

TitleName           Custom Rc Metadata
CompanyName         Artisan Softworks
Description         Metadata must not become a resource here
Version             3.2.1
Copyright           Copyright (c) $CompanyName
